  shortStory: "A hunter named Ramon froze as a loud, hysterical burst of laughter
    echoed through the woods.\r\n\r\nStepping into the clearing was the Bungisngis\u2014a
    massive giant with sweeping elephant tusks and a single, huge eye in the middle
    of its forehead, clutching its belly in amusement.\r\n\r\nKnowing the giant was
    absurdly strong but easily fooled, Ramon grabbed a smooth river stone, grinned,
    and threw it playfully over his own shoulder.\r\n\r\nEager to join the game,
    the Bungisngis gleefully grabbed a massive boulder and hurled it backward over
    its head. The rock crashed straight down onto the giant\u2019s own back, knocking
    it flat into the mud.\r\n\r\nWhile the dazed creature chuckled softly at its
    own blunder, Ramon slipped away unnoticed into the trees.\r\n"
